    "$t": "341期編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">世界一直leh變化，lán人也tio̍h知變竅。親像疫情，若流行ê病毒株無仝，tio̍h-ài有無仝ê防疫政策。〈Uì Alpha到Omicron：新冠肺炎橫逆ê時代〉、〈是按怎uè著新冠病毒tiānn-tiānn ē鼻無芳臭？〉hōo lán了解病毒ê變化kap對人體ê影響。親像語言，tī優勢ê華語環境內，想beh實踐台語家庭ê人按怎突破？拄著啥款問題？來看〈我ê台語家庭經驗〉kap〈聽總統府台語導覽了後寫ê一張批〉。親像鄉土，〈行，lán去龜山島樂園！〉、〈大坪頂、小港，我ê愛〉lóng leh思考按怎去認bat、寶惜已經生疏--去ê故鄉。世界一直leh變化，你若m̄甘心肝頭ê記憶就án-ne無--去，請你用台語文kā寫--落-來，替tsit个時代做記錄。</span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg8Nk1mjxvwubBG6niP6W4HD9idzxjScc7R_k9tA62awuHg9gH0qiFCl3RyfzL_STVQihzShCMh-6cWvPgNTKA6WZa7VN57KLvAlfn9nKB8rQtN0iheqBjGvSDY2aW7AXuzjf6yc9j5sVeHksvU_Q04MPEom-JYe_ncAWzOTianUfhMVxNp6OZQtGOAfw/s1424/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg8Nk1mjxvwubBG6niP6W4HD9idzxjScc7R_k9tA62awuHg9gH0qiFCl3RyfzL_STVQihzShCMh-6cWvPgNTKA6WZa7VN57KLvAlfn9nKB8rQtN0iheqBjGvSDY2aW7AXuzjf6yc9j5sVeHksvU_Q04MPEom-JYe_ncAWzOTianUfhMVxNp6OZQtGOAfw/w450-h640/341%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgqnqkfJEYRTTZw3RPh4pRq_MFhVPx3loWrBUg1jftgMfwW9HBhxYGCIzePb0fGalIzV9nWK31goUcYxKbL6rQHLUHHBcm_AL6K50xga6YHKLegsS-ajyhGPGO8Y_7UHO-PuaswjrAVzTPsTUY4pTaXlfSqhNVkAzV4GNxkDcQ0os-J1wg--KR6j4qFJg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1341%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E9%83%A8.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height